 {'group': 'ZeroCostModel with non‑zero trades', 'cases': [{'input': [], 'expected': 'Num value equal to ZeroCostModel.ZERO (i.e., Num representing 0)', 'description': 'Even when the Position has entry and exit trades with non‑zero amounts and prices, using the built‑in ZeroCostModel must still yield a holding cost of zero. Construct such a Position, call getHoldingCost(), and assert the result is zero.'}]}]
